<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">irrādo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inr-</span></b> ), 3, v. a.
		1. in-rado. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To scrape into</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eodem silphium irradito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 157, 7</span></i>
			; cf. § 8.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To scrape</i>, <i>shave</i>, <i>make smooth</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caput irrasum,</span>”
				<i>shaved</i>, <i>bald</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 5, 2, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
